# Changelog
## v1.1.0-alpha
### Added
- Audio for sentences
- Characters view seperation between HSK levels
- Characters view search for character
- Improvment in query speed
- Word feedback - share your feedback about a word. Accesible from Advanced Settings in Word Card
- Splash screen for app loading

### Changed
- Size of ABCD buttons for hanzi
- Style of buttons for word managing
- Description and naming of button and fields
- Some UI/UX
- Style unification

### Fixed
- Search with known characters should involve characters in input field as a part of set
- Ugly filter buttons
- Pinyin and audio for some words
